+bench/tests/test_prose_acceptance_stem.py
+bench/tests/test_falsifier_abstains_on_an_absent_target_2026-09-30.py -q` →
+**250 passed**.
+
+**Reported, not fixed: `_MD_PY_FENCE` (`reference_runner_v3.py:10559`) has zero
